 " reads the triple product from."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"97f9d442-5180-476e-a568-8e1dcf6407ab"],

Cell["\<\
An algebra object without a list of basis monomials, integer degrees and a \
Gram matrix of the matching size returns unevaluated.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"3cd987bb-860f-4b6e-a00c-060a358e2d29"],

